{"3812600":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"ReStory: Chill Electronics Repairs","steam_appid":3812600,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"dlc":[5020360,5034500],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ReStory is a chill, narrative-driven shop management simulator from the creators of I Am Future, set on the bustling streets of mid-2000s Tokyo and featuring an in-depth device repair system. <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you run an electronics repair shop, meticulously restore nostalgic Y2K-era devices, including officially licensed Atari consoles, and interact with customers to experience a branching storyline with multiple endings that depend on your choices.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/ff52b2fc3caaa3b4090a719dc25c77cc.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet customers, take their devices in for repairs, manage your finances, and surf the web for spare parts. Relax and enjoy running your own small shop in a game created with love and respect for the one-of-a-kind vibe of the Japanese urban life in the mid-2000s.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/47e9ec9530e15f8d18ee159f29ce4aa8.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix a variety of nostalgic devices inspired by iconic game consoles, handhelds, phones, cameras, music players, and home appliances. Carefully take each gadget apart, clean it, replace faulty parts, and assemble it back together using your trusty toolset.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/4aca32838df917feebda269d9a06fa6b.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you interact with each customer can change their lives forever. Will you report on a disturbing find inside the former gangster’s phone, or help a lovestruck student confess to his crush? Make your own choices and see how they impact the branching storyline.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing electronics repair shop management<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of nostalgic 2000s devices to repair<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth device cleaning and restoration system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y2K-era web browser to hunt for spare parts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of in-person and online orders to fulfill<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tools for device repairs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic Atari consoles, officially licensed for the game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers with unique stories and dialogues<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable branching storyline with choices impacting the ending<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinct, chill vibe of urban life in Japan<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/a3b75ca8623e241e01f1afb51970be16.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ReStory is a chill, narrative-driven shop management simulator from the creators of I Am Future, set on the bustling streets of mid-2000s Tokyo and featuring an in-depth device repair system. <\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this game, you run an electronics repair shop, meticulously restore nostalgic Y2K-era devices, including officially licensed Atari consoles, and interact with customers to experience a branching storyline with multiple endings that depend on your choices.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/ff52b2fc3caaa3b4090a719dc25c77cc.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/3dafb9ac64ec02c9e0c444ecf1b210e0.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Greet customers, take their devices in for repairs, manage your finances, and surf the web for spare parts. Relax and enjoy running your own small shop in a game created with love and respect for the one-of-a-kind vibe of the Japanese urban life in the mid-2000s.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/47e9ec9530e15f8d18ee159f29ce4aa8.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/d9799007dd6a01709a0a5549b6a5c826.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fix a variety of nostalgic devices inspired by iconic game consoles, handhelds, phones, cameras, music players, and home appliances. Carefully take each gadget apart, clean it, replace faulty parts, and assemble it back together using your trusty toolset.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/4aca32838df917feebda269d9a06fa6b.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=122 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.poster.avif?t=1786119982\" width=780 height=350 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.webm?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/extras\/2dcda4ef2f961bb8da50fdc0a5fefc19.mp4?t=1786119982\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The way you interact with each customer can change their lives forever. Will you report on a disturbing find inside the former gangster’s phone, or help a lovestruck student confess to his crush? Make your own choices and see how they impact the branching storyline.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features<\/strong><\/h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relaxing electronics repair shop management<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of nostalgic 2000s devices to repair<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-depth device cleaning and restoration system<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Y2K-era web browser to hunt for spare parts<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of in-person and online orders to fulfill<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple tools for device repairs<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Iconic Atari consoles, officially licensed for the game<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customers with unique stories and dialogues<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable branching storyline with choices impacting the ending<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A distinct, chill vibe of urban life in Japan<\/p><\/li><\/ul>","short_description":"Run a quaint electronics repair shop in mid-2000s Tokyo. Grow your business by carefully restoring iconic video game consoles, cell phones, music players, and other nostalgic devices. Talk to customers, hear their stories, and see how your decisions impact both their lives and your shop.","supported_languages":"English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese","reviews":"“It’s almost hard to believe that scrubbing down metal frames and twisting screws could be such a pleasant activity, but I can’t stop doing it to unwind.”<br>5\/5 – Monstervine<br><br>“Combines 2000s nostalgia, restoration mechanics and a turbulent storyline for hours of fiddly fun.”<br>8\/10 – The Wand Report<br><br>“I had a really good time with ReStory, [...] It's full of charm, and just overall a great experience.”<br>Recommended – Netto's Game Room<br>","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/c07daeca18353c666d51462d2e69c30ec68094ad\/header_alt_assets_3.jpg?t=1786119982","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/fcf913006c05b4afafbfd25388bf4e3fe8bb1f04\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786119982","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3812600\/fcf913006c05b4afafbfd25388bf4e3fe8bb1f04\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786119982","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Win10 x64<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> 2-core \/ 4-thread CPU<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GTX 750ti<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 1 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> macOS 14 or newer<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1